#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GTK+ 2"
msgstr "Instalação do GTK+ 2"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>GTK+ 2</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>GTK+ 2</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:113
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's#l \\(gtk-.*\\).sgml#&amp; -o \\1#' \\\n"
"    -i docs/{faq,tutorial}/Makefile.in                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"patch -p1 -i ../gtk+-&gtk2-version;-consolidated_fixes-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc             &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's#l \\(gtk-.*\\).sgml#&amp; -o \\1#' \\\n"
"    -i docs/{faq,tutorial}/Makefile.in                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"patch -p1 -i ../gtk+-&gtk2-version;-consolidated_fixes-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc             &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>make -k check</command>. Note that you "
"must run the tests from a session with X Window Display capability (i.e., "
"not a text-based terminal/console) as the tests attempt to open an X window,"
" and the tests can take an excessively long time. Using an X Window, the "
"tests should take less than 0.1 SBU. One test, aliasfilescheck.sh, is known "
"to fail."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: &quot;<command>make -k "
"check</command>&quot;. Observe que você precisa executar os testes a partir "
"de uma sessão com capacidade de exibição de janela do &quot;X&quot; (ou "
"seja, não um terminal/console baseado em texto), pois os testes tentam abrir"
" uma janela do &quot;X&quot; e os testes podem demorar excessivamente. "
"Usando uma janela do &quot;X&quot;, os testes deveriam levar menos que 0,1 "
"UPC. Um teste, &quot;aliasfilescheck.sh&quot;, é conhecido por falhar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:132
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you installed the package on to your system using a "
"<quote>DESTDIR</quote> method, an important file was not installed and must "
"be copied and/or generated. Generate it using the following command as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou o pacote em teu sistema usando o método "
"<quote>DESTDIR</quote>, [então] um arquivo importante não foi instalado e "
"precisa ser copiado e (ou) gerado. Gere-o usando o seguinte comando como "
"o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:142
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>gtk-query-immodules-2.0 --update-cache</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>gtk-query-immodules-2.0 --update-cache</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:151
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed -i 's#l \\(gtk-.*\\).sgml#&amp; -o \\1#' "
"docs/{faq,tutorial}/Makefile.in</command>: If you have <xref "
"linkend=\"docbook-utils\"/> installed (specifically, if configure finds "
"<command>db2html</command>) then it will try to use it to rebuild some of "
"its HTML documentation and fail due to bugs in some of the "
"<filename>Makefile</filename>s. This <command>sed</command> fixes the "
"<filename>Makefile</filename>s."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -i 's#l \\(gtk-.*\\).sgml#&amp; -o \\1#' "
"docs/{faq,tutorial}/Makefile.in</command>: Se você tiver o &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"docbook-utils\"/>&quot; instalado (especificamente, se o "
"&quot;configure&quot; encontrar &quot;<command>db2html</command>&quot;), "
"então ele tentará usá-lo para reconstruir parte da documentação "
"&quot;HTML&quot; dele e falhará devido a defeitos em alguns dos "
"&quot;<filename>Makefile</filename>s&quot;. Esse "
"&quot;<command>sed</command>&quot; corrige os "
"&quot;<filename>Makefile</filename>s&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:161
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>patch -p1 -i ../gtk+-&gtk2-version;-consolidated_fixes-1.patch "
"...</command>: This patch allows the package to compile with gcc-14 and also"
" prevents loading modules from the current directory."
msgstr ""

