msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:207
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>GTK+ 2</application> themes change the way a <application>GTK+ "
"2</application> application looks. A <application>GTK+ 2</application> icon "
"theme can be used to change the icons that appear on the application's "
"toolbar. If you have installed a <application>GTK+ 2</application> theme "
"(such as <xref linkend=\"gnome-themes-extra\"/> or <xref linkend=\"gtk-"
"engines\"/>), or a <application>GTK+</application> icon theme (such as <xref"
" linkend=\"adwaita-icon-theme\"/>) you can set your preferences in "
"<filename>~/.gtkrc-2.0</filename>:"
msgstr ""
"Os temas do &quot;<application>GTK+ 2</application>&quot; mudam a aparência "
"de um aplicativo &quot;<application>GTK+ 2</application>&quot;. Um tema de "
"ícone do &quot;<application>GTK+ 2</application>&quot; pode ser usado para "
"mudar os ícones que aparecem na barra de ferramentas do aplicativo. Se tiver"
" instalado um tema do &quot;<application>GTK+ 2</application>&quot; (como "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"gnome-themes-extra\"/>&quot; ou &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"gtk-engines\"/>&quot;), ou um tema de ícone do "
"&quot;<application>GTK+</application>&quot; (como &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"adwaita-icon-theme\"/>&quot;), [então] você consegue configurar "
"tuas preferências em &quot;<filename>~/.gtkrc-2.0</filename>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:219
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.gtkrc-2.0 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>include \"/usr/share/themes/<replaceable>Glider</replaceable>/gtk-2.0/gtkrc\"\n"
"gtk-icon-theme-name = \"<replaceable>hicolor</replaceable>\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.gtkrc-2.0 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>include \"/usr/share/themes/<replaceable>Glider</replaceable>/gtk-2.0/gtkrc\"\n"
"gtk-icon-theme-name = \"<replaceable>hicolor</replaceable>\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:225
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are many more themes available at <ulink url=\"https://gnome-"
"look.org/\">Gnome-Look.org</ulink> and other places."
msgstr ""
"Existem muitos mais temas disponíveis em &quot;<ulink url=\"https://gnome-"
"look.org/\">Gnome-Look.org</ulink>&quot; e em outros lugares."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:231
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Once you've settled on themes you like, you can (as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user) make them the default system "
"wide:"
msgstr ""
"Depois que tiver definido os temas que gosta, você pode (como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;) "
"torná-los o padrão em todo o sistema:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+2.xml:236
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/gtk-2.0/gtkrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>include \"/usr/share/themes/<replaceable>Clearlooks</replaceable>/gtk-2.0/gtkrc\"\n"
"gtk-icon-theme-name = \"<replaceable>elementary</replaceable>\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/gtk-2.0/gtkrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>include \"/usr/share/themes/<replaceable>Clearlooks</replaceable>/gtk-2.0/gtkrc\"\n"
"gtk-icon-theme-name = \"<replaceable>elementary</replaceable>\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

